WEBVTT

00:05:28.804 --> 00:05:30.876
It's just the way
you throw your board over.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:33.160
Just let the ledge do that, and it's easy,

00:05:33.184 --> 00:05:35.584
and the next thing you know,
there's 20 more tricks

00:05:35.608 --> 00:05:37.096
based out of the variations.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:39.753
So that's the kind of thing --
here, check this out,

00:05:39.777 --> 00:05:41.838
here's another way,
and I won't overdo this.

00:05:41.862 --> 00:05:43.516
A little indulgent, I understand.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.552
There's something called a Primo slide.

00:05:47.642 --> 00:05:50.168
It is the funnest trick ever to do.

00:05:53.528 --> 00:05:54.845
It's like skimboarding.

00:05:56.052 --> 00:05:58.961
And this one, look how it slides
sideways, every which way?

00:05:58.985 --> 00:06:01.813
OK, so when you're skating,
and you take a fall,